{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 35,
      "width": 1792,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# ByteTicks\nDesktop trading and analysis for cryptocurrency markets.\n\nFrom live market observation to historical research, order management, and trade review.\n\nActive development / Pre-MVP."
    },
    {
      "id": "observe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 568,
      "height": 610,
      "text": "## Observe\nUnderstand price, volume, and visible liquidity.\n\n- Live trades, order books, price charts, and indicators.\n- Footprints, volume profiles, and liquidity heatmaps.\n- Multiple charts with saved, reusable workspace layouts."
    },
    {
      "id": "investigate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 676,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 568,
      "height": 610,
      "text": "## Investigate\nTurn observations into testable market conditions.\n\n- Define market conditions and alerts.\n- Record and revisit market history locally.\n- Replay history, backtest supported conditions, and inspect run reports.\n\nReplay and backtesting are partially implemented and evolving. Coverage depends on available history and supported scenarios."
    },
    {
      "id": "trade-review",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1288,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 568,
      "height": 610,
      "text": "## Trade & review\nPlace orders, track positions, and review results.\n\n- Place and cancel orders; manage positions.\n- Paper trading for simulated execution.\n- Trade journal, fills, and basic result analysis.\n\nExchange-connected trading is limited to supported test/demo workflows. Real-money trading is not available."
    },
    {
      "id": "engineering-group",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 1792,
      "height": 380,
      "label": "Engineering scope / Problems addressed"
    },
    {
      "id": "engineering-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 824,
      "height": 136,
      "text": "### Consistent market context\nKeep live streams, recorded history, indicators, and alerts aligned across data sources, instruments, and time ranges."
    },
    {
      "id": "engineering-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 988,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 824,
      "height": 136,
      "text": "### Dense, responsive charts\nRender detailed order-flow views across multiple charts while data arrives, within memory and processing budgets."
    },
    {
      "id": "engineering-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 1159,
      "width": 824,
      "height": 136,
      "text": "### Durable market history\nHandle continuous recording, time-window queries, retention, and recovery of stored market data."
    },
    {
      "id": "engineering-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 988,
      "y": 1159,
      "width": 824,
      "height": 136,
      "text": "### Trading state and recovery\nKeep orders, fills, positions, balances, and journal results coherent across asynchronous updates and connection interruptions."
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 1792,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "React / TypeScript / Rust / Tauri\n\nActive development toward the first MVP. No commercial release yet.\nThe main application source code is private."
    }
  ],
